{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27629","headline":"中秋夜杭州翫月 · 张祜","name":"中秋夜杭州翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万古太阴精，中秋海上生。\n鬼愁缘辟照，人爱爲高明。\n历历华星远，霏霏薄晕萦。\n影流江不尽，轮曳谷无声。\n似镜当楼晓，如珠出浦盈。\n岸沙全借白，山木半含清。\n小槛循环看，长堤蹋阵行。\n殷勤未归客，烟水夜来情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}